<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Applied Materials rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Applied Materials rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Chicago Corp said Monday it initiated coverage of Applied Materials Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $55.</p>
<p>--Its FY97 earnings per share estimate on the company is $1.75.</p>
<p>--Applied Materials supplies wafer fabrication systems to the semiconductor industry.</p>
<p>--Applied Materials was trading at 38-5/8, up 1-1/8.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
